  <summary>&lt;p>Compact shutdown applet for Plasma Desktop providing the following actions:&lt;br />- Logout&lt;br />- Lock Screen&lt;br />- Suspend&lt;br />- Hibernate&lt;br />- Reboot&lt;br />- Shutdown&lt;br />&lt;br />Some distributions will require the creation of a symbolic link to qdbus for this applet to function.&lt;br />e.g. sudo ln -s /usr/lib64/qt5/bin/qdbus /usr/bin/qdbus&lt;br />&lt;br />In some cases qdbus-qt5 may need to installed.&lt;br />e.g. sudo apt install qdbus-qt5&lt;/p></summary>
