  <summary>&lt;p>forked from &lt;a href="https://www.pling.com/p/2151247">https://www.pling.com/p/2151247&lt;/a>&lt;br />Win7 Show Desktop [Plasma 6]&lt;br />&lt;br />[deskhide v1.0 27-09-2025]&lt;br />&lt;br />i updated this to work with plasma 6.6 dev since it was broken with this version of kde desktop coming and needed it since i make distributions with this widget&lt;br />&lt;br />install method for plasma 6 install from kde widget store on desktop or download from browser extract and place in /home/$USER/.local/share/plasma/plasmoids/&lt;br /> right click taskbar click add or manage widgets and type deskhide place widget on taskbar &lt;br />or simply right click current hide widget and select show alternatives and select deskhide &lt;br />right again on deskhide and select config deskhide then select minimize all windows and click apply for it to work flawlessly&lt;br />&lt;br />thank you for downloading hope you enjoy&lt;/p></summary>
